Golden test data: excerpt.json

excerpt.json holds text segments (ids, times, speech-to-text wording) of about 3.4 minutes of
Lecture 22 (gradient descent) of MIT OpenCourseWare 18.065
(Matrix Methods in Data Analysis, Signal Processing, and Machine Learning, Spring 2018),
taught by Prof. Gilbert Strang. The text was produced by our own speech-to-text run on the
lecture video. No audio or video is stored in this repository.

